&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Building the world’s leading&amp;nbsp;full-stack fulfillment platform&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;challenging&amp;nbsp;work. The problems we solve are complex, the pace is fast, and the bar is high.&amp;nbsp;That means&amp;nbsp;ShipBob’s&amp;nbsp;environment&amp;nbsp;isn’t&amp;nbsp;the right&amp;nbsp;fit for everyone, and&amp;nbsp;that’s&amp;nbsp;okay.&amp;nbsp;If you are ready to take ownership,&amp;nbsp;push boundaries, and&amp;nbsp;grow alongside a team that genuinely supports each other, we would love to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Learn more about our core values and how we perform at a high level in our day-to-day work on our Culture page (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.shipbob.com/careers/culture/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;About Us: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun Highlight SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob is a leading global supply chain and fulfillment technology platform designed for SMB and Mid-Market ecommerce merchants to provide them access to best-in-class capabilities and to deliver a delightful shopper experience. Merchants can outsource their entire fulfillment operations, utilize &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; proprietary warehouse management system for in-house fulfillment, or take advantage of a hybrid solution across &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob’s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; dozens of fulfillment center network in the United States, Canada, United Kingdom, Europe, and Australia. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt; is backed by leading investors like Menlo Ventures, Bain Capital Ventures, Hyde Park Venture Partners, and SoftBank Vision Fund 2, and is one of the fastest-growing tech companies headquartered in Chicago.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At ShipBob, every full-time employee gets access to our best-in-class AI and productivity tools from Day 1 at no cost. This isn&#39;t a pilot or a perk for select teams. It&#39;s standard for everyone. We believe innovation isn&#39;t owned by one department. Whether you&#39;re in Talent, Operations, Finance, Engineering, or Customer Success, we expect you to ask: &lt;em&gt;how can this be done better, faster, or smarter?&lt;/em&gt; These tools are our investment in your ability to find those answers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of AI-Assisted Tools During Recruitment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We may use AI-assisted tools during the recruitment process to support administrative functions such as transcribing interviews, generating summaries or notes, organizing interview feedback, facilitating candidate communications, and helping recruiters identify candidates whose qualifications may align with job requirements. These tools are designed to assist our recruiting team and are not used to make final hiring decisions.&amp;nbsp;Hiring decisions are made by trained human reviewers who consider the candidate&#39;s application, interview performance, qualifications, experience, and other relevant factors. AI-assisted tools do not independently determine whether a candidate advances in the hiring process or receives an offer of employment.&amp;nbsp;Where required by applicable law, candidates will be provided with notice regarding our use of AI-assisted technologies and, where available, information about any applicable rights relating to such processing, including the ability to request additional information or opt out of certain AI-assisted processing activities. Candidates who exercise available opt-out rights may be reviewed through alternative processes consistent with applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;ShipBob provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state or local laws.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;ompensation&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot;&gt;and training.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW177749497 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW263457653 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;There is no deadline to apply for this position, as ShipBob accepts applications on an ongoing basis&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Editions, our network of delivery-only kitchens, is a key differentiator in France commercial ambition. &lt;/strong&gt;The Account Management Lead – Editions France role is created as part of a wider reorganisation of the Editions business as part of our regional strategy. The role reports to Paris regional leadership and is designed to combine strategic partner leadership, P&amp;amp;L ownership and organisation building across the Editions network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As &lt;strong&gt;Account Management Lead – Editions France&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead the Editions commercial team for France constituted of Senior Account Managers, Account Managers and Sales Managers. You will be the guardian of the Editions strategy for France, accountable for its coordination and its execution on the ground, growing the performance and profitability of our sites while driving occupancy and the differentiation Editions brings to the French market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own a portion of the Editions P&amp;amp;L. That means holding the commercial scorecard for new kitchens, making financial decisions with a clear view of both partner and Deliveroo profitability, and steering your team&#39;s portfolio towards sustainable growth rather than volume alone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be accountable for the development plan for your team, their success and learning curve at Deliveroo; setting the right KPIs and OKRs to monitor the business. Your role will be commercially focused, however Editions is as much a project management discipline as a commercial one: you will work hand in hand with Food Safety, Compliance, Site Construction, Kitchen Layout, Site Operations, Marketing and the International Editions team to bring kitchens live and keep them performing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Editions Strategy &amp;amp; Growth&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the guardian of the Editions strategy for France, ensuring its coordination across teams and its disciplined execution site by site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead your team&#39;s portfolio strategy, growing the performance and profitability of each Editions site in line with agreed targets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop the business so that it fits within, and contributes to, the wider regional strategy, bringing the specificity of the French network to regional and international forums&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build and deliver joint business plans with restaurant partners, identifying growth and profitability opportunities, defining mutual goals and finding compelling ways to solve them (menu optimisation, virtual brands, pricing, packaging, catchment expansion)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with the Media team to identify and negotiate revenue opportunities to generate additional value from Editions sites&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Occupancy &amp;amp; Commercial Performance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own the occupancy trajectory of the French network, partnering closely with Local teams to positively drive occupancy and secure signed contracts within agreed timelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own and enforce the Editions commercial scorecard for new kitchens, profitability checks against P&amp;amp;L guidelines, launch package, site specificities, ensuring the process is applied consistently across the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steer the lead generation and pipeline process, mapping high-potential restaurants and cuisine gaps by site, and mobilising other commercial stakeholders to qualify interest&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead commercial negotiations with business owners and C-suite operators, supporting proposals with a robust P&amp;amp;L rationale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;P&amp;amp;L Ownership &amp;amp; Governance&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Own a portion of the Editions P&amp;amp;L, accountable for revenue, profitability and the financial health of your perimeter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Set, own and deliver performance targets across occupancy, partner health, site profitability and Deliveroo output metrics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run a clear operating rhythm on reporting, velocity, sign-to-live, occupancy and sales reviews, and use it to make decisions, not just to describe results&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kitchen Launches &amp;amp; Cross-functional Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work with Site Managers, Food Safety, Compliance, Site Construction and Kitchen Layout teams to secure the successful build and launch of new kitchens&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coordinate with Global team on kitchen implementation, and with Marketing and Operations on launch packages, so that every opening lands on time and performs from week one&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage and oversee project execution end to end, including B2B communication and cross-business-unit workshops&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Propose process optimisation and automation: Deliveroo moves fast, and you will improve the processes that let Editions scale&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Senior Stakeholder Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as the senior point of contact and face of Deliveroo Editions for top restaurant partners, building trusted, long-term relationships and representing Deliveroo at partner events&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Establish a strong operating rhythm with partners, including quarterly business reviews and monthly performance check-ins&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to senior stakeholders, providing strategic insights on Deliveroo, competitors and broader industry trends&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team Leadership: Support and coach your Account Managers and Sales Managers to build and execute strong commercial and operational plans, and to raise the standard of account management across the Editions network&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Need to Thrive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7+ years working in commercially focused roles&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience managing medium-sized commercial or account management teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Highly analytical, with proven P&amp;amp;L ownership or strong financial decision-making experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Solid project management skills, with a track record of delivering complex, cross-functional projects on time&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mix of both strategy and execution experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable handling negotiations with business owners or C-suite operators&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Effective collaborator, able to influence internal stakeholders across functions and geographies, including global teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Relationship-building and communication skills whether face-to-face, through phone or email&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Adaptable and comfortable working in a rapidly changing environment; proactive and creative problem solver&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a passion for food and operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be in the field often, which will require travel (depending on the needs)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous general management experience, or experience running your own business would be desirable&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fluent in French and English is required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;min-height: 1.2em; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Public Sector Solutions Architect, you&#39;ll be a trusted advisor to U.S. government customers, helping them understand how GitLab&#39;s Enterprise Edition and DevSecOps platform can address real business and mission outcomes. You&#39;ll own the technical evaluation and validation stages of the sales cycle, guide customers through proofs of concept and value, and connect GitLab&#39;s modern software development, operations, and cloud capabilities to measurable value. In this role, you&#39;ll work closely with sales and cross-functional GitLab teams, provide technical guidance from first conversation through successful deployment, and act as a customer advocate back into Product, Sales, and Marketing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage with public sector customers, both onsite and remotely, to provide technical expertise and guidance throughout the pre-sales process, including tailored demos, technical presentations, and hands-on workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the sales team to shape and execute account strategies that drive GitLab adoption within government environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical evaluation process, including proof of concept (POC) and proof of value (POV) design and delivery, tender and audit support, and technical input into proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the creation of Customer Success Plans that capture technical success criteria and handoff details from the pre-sales process, ensuring a smooth path to deployment and adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and deepen relationships with technical and business stakeholders so they become advocates for GitLab within their organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the customer advocate internally by channeling feedback and insights to Product, Sales, Marketing, and other GitLab teams to influence roadmap and messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and expand your expertise in GitLab and related technologies, including modern software development, operations, and cloud practices, and create reusable examples and assets for customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run Value Stream Assessments to identify opportunities for customers to improve their software delivery with GitLab.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in technical pre-sales, consulting, or information technology roles, ideally with U.S. public sector or federal customers, where you guided customers through evaluations and solution design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience using GitLab and familiarity with modern software development and operations practices, such as CI/CD, DevSecOps, and automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud computing platforms and related technologies in regulated or security-conscious environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to connect technical solutions to measurable business or mission outcomes and to advise senior stakeholders on tradeoffs and options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, confident communication and relationship-building skills, including leading customer meetings, demos, and value-focused conversations in close partnership with sales and cross-functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to learning, seeking feedback, and building new skills, including familiarity with GitLab&#39;s Solutions Architect handbook and related resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Public Sector Solutions Architect role is part of GitLab&#39;s Solutions Architect team, a group of trusted technical advisors who help government customers understand, evaluate, and adopt the GitLab DevSecOps platform. The team is distributed and collaborates asynchronously across time zones using GitLab and our handbook-first practices to share knowledge, reusable examples, and best practices. You&#39;ll help the team address unique public sector challenges such as security, compliance, and mission-critical software delivery, and contribute customer insights that shape our product direction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial(e) terrain indépendant(e) – SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous avez une réelle expérience de la prospection à froid, sur le terrain ou par téléphone ? Rejoignez SumUp et accompagnez les commerçants avec des solutions de paiement simples et reconnues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecter les cafés, restaurants, boutiques, salons et entreprises de votre secteur ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifier leurs besoins, présenter la solution adaptée et réaliser des démonstrations ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accompagner les commerçants jusqu’à l’activation et développer votre portefeuille.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;La prospection est réalisée par vos soins : aucun portefeuille de leads n’est fourni.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre rémunération&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette activité est rémunérée exclusivement à la commission, sans salaire fixe ni plafond :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;50 % de commission immédiate sur le matériel, les logiciels et les paiements générés par le commerçant au cours de son premier mois ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 % de revenus récurrents sur l’activité de chaque commerçant signé, versés mensuellement pendant une durée pouvant aller jusqu’à 24 mois.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exemple : un commerçant actif générant environ 15 000 € de volume de paiement mensuel peut vous permettre de percevoir plus de 1 000 € de commissions cumulées sur 24 mois.&lt;em&gt;Ce montant indicatif varie selon les produits vendus, l’activation, le volume réel et le maintien de l’activité du commerçant. Aucun revenu minimum n’est garanti.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos outils et votre organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp fournit une formation initiale, un terminal de démonstration et des supports commerciaux. Un référent de secteur reste disponible pour vous accompagner.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Votre zone est définie pendant le recrutement selon votre localisation et les secteurs ouverts. Vous organisez librement votre activité. Vos déplacements et les frais associés restent à votre charge ; aucun véhicule de fonction n’est fourni.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Au moins un an d’expérience en prospection à froid, terrain ou téléphonique, au cours des six dernières années ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;À l’aise dans une démarche commerciale proactive auprès de professionnels ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonome, persévérant(e), fiable et orienté(e) résultats ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disponible au moins trois jours par semaine ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numéro SIRET valide au démarrage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Processus de recrutement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Échange téléphonique avec notre équipe recrutement ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entretien avec le ou la référente de votre secteur ;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Décision rapide fondée sur votre expérience et votre motivation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Envie de développer votre activité avec une rémunération sans plafond et des revenus récurrents potentiels ? &lt;strong&gt;Postulez dès maintenant !&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vous aimez vendre, convaincre et aller directement à la rencontre de vos clients ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chez SumUp, nous aidons les commerçants du quotidien à développer leur activité grâce à des solutions de paiement et de gestion simples, accessibles et performantes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dans le cadre de notre croissance en France, nous recherchons un(e) commercial(e) terrain prêt(e) à partir à la conquête de nouveaux clients. Il s’agit d’un poste 100 % terrain : vous rencontrez directement les commerçants de votre secteur, identifiez leurs besoins, leur présentez nos solutions et les accompagnez jusqu’à la signature.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre rémunération&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous faisons le choix de la transparence dès le début du processus :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;30 000 € bruts annuels de salaire fixe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;27 600 € bruts annuels de variable cible&lt;/strong&gt;, à 100 % des objectifs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soit un &lt;strong&gt;package cible de 57 600 € bruts annuels&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Un &lt;strong&gt;variable entièrement déplafonné&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;(à titre d’exemple, les commerciaux les plus performants peuvent dépasser 100 000 € bruts de rémunération annuelle totale)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Les modalités précises du plan de commissionnement vous seront présentées pendant le processus de recrutement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospecter directement les commerçants de votre secteur : restaurateurs, artisans, indépendants et commerces de proximité&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprendre leurs besoins et leur présenter les solutions SumUp les plus adaptées&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Réaliser des démonstrations claires et convaincantes de nos produits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Négocier et conclure vos ventes directement sur le terrain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer l’intégralité du cycle de vente, du premier contact jusqu’à la signature&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Développer durablement votre secteur grâce à une prospection régulière et structurée&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suivre vos résultats et ajuster votre approche pour atteindre et dépasser vos objectifs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce que nous vous proposons&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Une formation complète et régulière à nos produits et à nos méthodes de vente&lt;/li&gt;
